    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Driving Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Driving Life</i>, a hardcore driving and survival experience set in the heart of rural America. Stranded on a remote island with barely any money, you\u2019ll have to scrape by, taking on driving jobs, managing expenses, and surviving on whatever cheap food and drinks you can afford.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/de052eb3d6477109388f3a6950417869.poster.avif?t=1754040540\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/de052eb3d6477109388f3a6950417869.webm?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/de052eb3d6477109388f3a6950417869.mp4?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>realistic driving model</strong>, manual transmissions, and a variety of vehicles to operate, <i>Driving Life</i> is a true test of skill and endurance. From small personal cars to minivans and even heavy-duty trucks, every vehicle demands mastery as you navigate the island\u2019s winding roads, dirt trails, and ferry routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/d7c3335ba0fda79f35ca09ffb4dd0864.poster.avif?t=1754040540\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/d7c3335ba0fda79f35ca09ffb4dd0864.webm?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/d7c3335ba0fda79f35ca09ffb4dd0864.mp4?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Realistic Driving Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Manual transmission, clutch control, and varied vehicle handling.<br>\ud83d\ude90 <strong>Diverse Vehicles</strong> \u2013 Drive everything from compact cars to massive trucks.<br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Hardcore Economy</strong> \u2013 Earn just enough to survive\u2026 if you play it smart.<br>\ud83c\udfe8 <strong>Island Life</strong> \u2013 Stay in a rundown motel, pay rent weekly, and work odd jobs.<br>\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Keep your car fueled, your stomach full, and your debts paid.<br>\ud83d\udea2 <strong>Ferry Routes</strong> \u2013 Transport tourists and goods between terminals to earn cash.<br>\ud83e\udd6b <strong>Survival on a Budget</strong> \u2013 Eat cheap meals, drink what you can afford, and don\u2019t blow your last dollar on a flashy car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure begins in a modest motel, where the owner might call you for work\u2014driving a van to pick up tourists from the ferry. You\u2019ll start with a clunky manual car, but if you manage your money wisely, you might just afford an upgrade. Be warned: every decision matters. Miss a rent payment? Run out of gas? Go broke? You\u2019re in trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you have what it takes to survive behind the wheel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/c7904bc1c079e9bab4239d234025e8d5.poster.avif?t=1754040540\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/c7904bc1c079e9bab4239d234025e8d5.webm?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/c7904bc1c079e9bab4239d234025e8d5.mp4?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Driving Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Driving Life</i>, a hardcore driving and survival experience set in the heart of rural America. Stranded on a remote island with barely any money, you\u2019ll have to scrape by, taking on driving jobs, managing expenses, and surviving on whatever cheap food and drinks you can afford.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/de052eb3d6477109388f3a6950417869.poster.avif?t=1754040540\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/de052eb3d6477109388f3a6950417869.webm?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/de052eb3d6477109388f3a6950417869.mp4?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>realistic driving model</strong>, manual transmissions, and a variety of vehicles to operate, <i>Driving Life</i> is a true test of skill and endurance. From small personal cars to minivans and even heavy-duty trucks, every vehicle demands mastery as you navigate the island\u2019s winding roads, dirt trails, and ferry routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/d7c3335ba0fda79f35ca09ffb4dd0864.poster.avif?t=1754040540\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/d7c3335ba0fda79f35ca09ffb4dd0864.webm?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/d7c3335ba0fda79f35ca09ffb4dd0864.mp4?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Realistic Driving Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Manual transmission, clutch control, and varied vehicle handling.<br>\ud83d\ude90 <strong>Diverse Vehicles</strong> \u2013 Drive everything from compact cars to massive trucks.<br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Hardcore Economy</strong> \u2013 Earn just enough to survive\u2026 if you play it smart.<br>\ud83c\udfe8 <strong>Island Life</strong> \u2013 Stay in a rundown motel, pay rent weekly, and work odd jobs.<br>\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Keep your car fueled, your stomach full, and your debts paid.<br>\ud83d\udea2 <strong>Ferry Routes</strong> \u2013 Transport tourists and goods between terminals to earn cash.<br>\ud83e\udd6b <strong>Survival on a Budget</strong> \u2013 Eat cheap meals, drink what you can afford, and don\u2019t blow your last dollar on a flashy car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adventure begins in a modest motel, where the owner might call you for work\u2014driving a van to pick up tourists from the ferry. You\u2019ll start with a clunky manual car, but if you manage your money wisely, you might just afford an upgrade. Be warned: every decision matters. Miss a rent payment? Run out of gas? Go broke? You\u2019re in trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you have what it takes to survive behind the wheel?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/c7904bc1c079e9bab4239d234025e8d5.poster.avif?t=1754040540\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/c7904bc1c079e9bab4239d234025e8d5.webm?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531470/extras/c7904bc1c079e9bab4239d234025e8d5.mp4?t=1754040540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
